  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cocoa certification for better incomes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project intends to promote certification of cocoa beans by Fair-trade FLOCERT to improve the income and livelihoods of smallholder cocoa farmers as well as communities. Specifically, the project aims ata)Smallholder farmers implementing good agricultural practices and managing their farms profitably with respect for people and planet as well as the certification guidelines. b)Increased investment in the cocoa industry and rewards to sustainable cocoa production. c)Women and men at the household level jointly making decisions that positively affect the cocoa value chain. d)Increased mitigation to climate change</narrative>
  </description>
